# --- Data store (DuckDB + Parquet + raw API cache) ---
# Tracked: code, specs, rubric, small gold-set CSVs, manifests.
# Ignored: bulk collected data and caches (regenerable / large / license-sensitive).
# Curated, hand-labeled gold set IS tracked (small, important); bulk sample is not.
data/**
!data/gold/
!data/gold/**
# small curated/derived tables from the org-provenance pivot ARE tracked:
!data/ai_evidence_repos.csv
!data/repo_contributors.csv
!data/resume_state/
!data/resume_state/**
raw/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.parquet

# Worktrees live OUTSIDE this repo, under ~/devel/<repo>-worktrees/, so no
# in-repo ignore is needed for them.

